5/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Merci ! Au revoir !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Thanks! Goodbye!</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Au revoir !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Goodbye!</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Au revoir !","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234587,"_nanoseconds":806000000}},{"id":"W5CXa1WFHDeBuKTy4ukH","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":20,"part":13,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l20-p13-b1","partTitle":"Speak freely","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.4rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Je te donne une pomme. Qu'est-ce que tu dis ?</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0 0 10px;\">I give you an apple. What do you say?</p><p><b>Use please and thank you.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.7;\">For example: “Une pomme, s'il te plaît. Merci !”</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Now it's your turn to speak!","expectedText":"Une pomme, s'il te plaît. Merci !","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234587,"_nanoseconds":915000000}},{"id":"rMHdURQ52LLRBeEh6HS0","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":20,"part":14,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l20-p14-b1","partTitle":"Well done","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:64px;line-height:1.1;\">🗝️</div><p><b>Magic words learned!</b></p></div><p style=\"line-height:1.6;\">🧑‍🏫 Please, thank you, you're welcome, sorry. Four little words that open every door.</p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234588,"_nanoseconds":16000000}}]